# Panels (8) — every web GlassPanel region, each a Fluent TsGlassPanel/Mica card
[x] panel  - GlassPanel1 -> FleetAPIPage.cs#_pollingPanel (BuildPollingPanel, TsGlassPanel): Tesla API Polling kill-switch — IconBox (pause/play) + PollingTitle + PollingStatus + _pollingToggle
[x] panel  - GlassPanel2 -> FleetAPIPage.cs#_suspendedNotePanel (BuildSuspendedNote, TsGlassPanel): danger-tinted suspended callout (pause glyph + SuspendedNote), visible when IsSuspended
[x] panel  - GlassPanel3 -> FleetAPIPage.cs#_controlsPanel (BuildControlsPanel, TsGlassPanel): API Endpoint Controls — shield IconBox + ControlsTitle + ControlsSubtitle + EnabledSummary + the four sections
[x] panel  - GlassPanel4 -> FleetAPIPage.cs#BuildEndpointCard (EndpointCard.Panel, TsGlassPanel): the reusable web EndpointToggle card (title+desc+TsToggle), one per polling/on-demand/command endpoint + the raw-recording card
[x] panel  - GlassPanel5 -> FleetAPIPage.cs#_retentionRow (BuildRetentionRow, TsGlassPanel): Retention Period row (title+desc + TsSelect), visible when ShowRetention
[x] panel  - GlassPanel6 -> FleetAPIPage.cs#_captureStatsChip (TsGlassPanel, Cyan glow): captured-signal chip (CaptureStatsText), visible when ShowCaptureStats
[x] panel  - GlassPanel7 -> FleetAPIPage.cs#_endpointsPanel (BuildEndpointsPanel, TsGlassPanel): API Endpoints — globe IconBox + EndpointsTitle + VersionSubtitle + configured list / empty state
[x] panel  - GlassPanel8 -> FleetAPIPage.cs#BuildConfiguredRow (TsGlassPanel): one configured-endpoint URL row (label Caption + url Code), one per version.endpoints entry

# Data states (3) — loading / empty / success, each a visible region (never blank)
[x] state  - loading -> FleetApiState.Loading + FleetApiDisplay.ShowLoading (FleetApiProjection.Project) -> PageContainer.IsLoading; test FleetAPIPageTests.State_loading_when_first_read_in_flight
[x] state  - empty   -> FleetApiState.Empty + ShowEndpointsEmpty -> FleetAPIPage.cs#_endpointsEmpty (TsEmptyState, common.noData); tests State_empty_when_no_configured_endpoints / ViewModel_empty_feed_is_the_empty_state
[x] state  - success -> FleetApiState.Success + ShowConfiguredEndpoints -> FleetAPIPage.cs#_configuredList (GlassPanel8 rows); tests State_success_when_configured_endpoints_present / ViewModel_loads_all_four_reads_into_success

